way)\n\nThe cylindrical puzzle grid means the action is always on all sides.\n \nCompete against your friends!!!\n- Discover infinite play mode to challenge your friends for the highest score.", "short_description": "\"\u2018Hex\u2019 Is The \u2018Tetris\u2019 Style VR Puzzle Game You\u2019ve Been Waiting For\" -Upload VR\n\nTake on wave after wave of ever faster gameplay in this addictive and challenging puzzler. \n\n- Unlock power-ups \n- Discover new tactics\n- Unlock game modes\n- Rack up highscores\n- Keep calm as things get frantic\n\nThe goal is simple: make a line from top to bottom; but as time and space become scarce you'll need to think and act quickly.\n\nPlay seated or standing to make use of the 360\u00b0 grid. (You can win either way)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://coplanargames.com/hex/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://coplanargames.com/hex/tos.html", "publisher_name": "Coplanar Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://coplanargames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2031486287022729"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 8, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1229785097217907"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "759283550939313"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "469491553390665"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "344364036394048"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1422003954583209"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "456859661779961"}, {"